00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:59.900
mechanic, even though it's not very deep.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:06.960
I like a lot of the aspects like that, but it was okay in practice.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.360
All right. Joe? Yeah.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:15.680
I mean, I was pretty optimistic right away because of the map, the overworld map, it kind

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.420
of gave it a feel of, like, an adventure.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:22.640
