but the good news is, is that there's only, like, four different possibilities and once

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.660
you learn them once, you know how to do them for each one.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:56.660
Well, you say that's good.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.380
Sorry. They're not really that difficult to learn.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:02.040
Like, it's, maybe it throws you off a little bit that there's no explanation.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:07.900
The tower, not towering Inferno, the Inferno one is kind of hard to figure out what you're

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:09.300
supposed to do. Blazing Inferno.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.600
Yeah. And I would say that the Poison Field one, too, which is the only one we haven't mentioned yet,

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:17.120
that's when you're collecting spirits, and I think that, like, if you don't get that

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:21.460
one first, you might assume that those things are enemies and shoot them instead of collect

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:23.540
them. I do agree that the Poison Field was tough.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:27.200
The Blazing Inferno, I thought, maybe I just got lucky, but...

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:32.480
I honestly thought that that candle or, like, the lighter or whatever was something that

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.920
was going to hit me and hurt me.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:36.100
Yeah, and I kept running away from it and it kept following me.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.780
I think maybe we, you know, because I think that covers the objective for now.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:42.500
There is more to the game, but I think that's all you really need to know.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:46.560
To get started, maybe we go through each kind of, each thing, you know?

