00:31:11.160 --> 00:31:16.740
And a huge problem for video game developers was that they would spend all this time making

00:31:16.740 --> 00:31:21.620
the games and people could just rent them from Blockbuster as opposed to buying them.

00:31:21.780 --> 00:31:26.240
They'd be robbed of the sale and then Blockbuster could just get the game back and you could

00:31:26.240 --> 00:31:27.420
rent it again through them.

00:31:28.120 --> 00:31:30.700
Nintendo actually winds up suing Blockbuster down the line.

00:31:30.700 --> 00:31:34.080
